# Deus Ex: the left stick is a ring of keys; a half push walks and a full push runs (Shift via zone).
setup packs/deus-ex.padpack Deus Ex
stick left 0 -1
advance 60
stick left 0.7 -0.7
advance 60
stick left 0 0
advance 60
---
key KEY_W down @0
key KEY_W up   @60
key KEY_W down @60
key KEY_D down @60
key KEY_D up   @120
key KEY_W up   @120
key KEY_W down @120
key KEY_W up   @120
